      "seed": 779576,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 989244,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "Transmission Control Protocol (TCP)",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "topic-mu426zol-20"
    },
    {
      "id": "sub-mu426zol-28",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -153,
      "y": 997,
      "width": 306,
      "height": 51,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ced4da",
      "backgroundColor": "#212529",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp_mu426zop_2"
      ],
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 30464,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 873452,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "sub-mu426zol-28_text",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sub-mu426zol-28_text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -141,
      "y": 1012,
      "width": 282,
      "height": 22,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp_mu426zop_2"
      ],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 138540,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 564970,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "Reliable Transmission & ARQ",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sub-mu426zol-28"
    },
    {
      "id": "sub-mu426zol-28-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -168,
      "y": 757,
      "width": 306,
      "height": 190,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp_mu426zop_2"
      ],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1663,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 820603,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "TCP treats payload data as an\nunstructured stream of bytes. Sequence\nnumbers track the first byte in each\nsegment. The receiver issues cumulative\nACKs indicating the next expected byte.\nIf 3 duplicate ACKs arrive, Fast\nRetransmit immediately resends the\nmissing segment without waiting for the\nRetransmission Timeout (RTO) timer to\nexpire.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "sub-mu426zol-32",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 380,
      "y": 1187,
      "width": 334,
      "height": 51,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ced4da",
      "backgroundColor": "#212529",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp_mu426zop_2"
      ],
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 342523,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 454739,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "sub-mu426zol-32_text",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sub-mu426zol-32_text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 392,
      "y": 1202,
      "width": 310,
      "height": 22,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp_mu426zop_2"
      ],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 444897,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 291353,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "Congestion Control & Avoidance",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sub-mu426zol-32"
    },
    {
      "id": "sub-mu426zol-32-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 405,
      "y": 1278,
      "width": 298,
      "height": 76,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp_mu426zop_2"
      ],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 759915,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 797261,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "TCP regulates network load via\nCongestion Window (cwnd) maintained by\nthe sender. Transmission rate is\nthrottled to min(cwnd, rwnd).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-mu426zol-34",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 1053,
      "width": 225,
      "height": 49,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ced4da",
      "backgroundColor": "#1a1a1f",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp_mu426zop_2"
      ],
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 482153,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 799957,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "flow-mu426zol-34_text",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-mu426zol-34_text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 410,
      "y": 1068,
      "width": 205,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp_mu426zop_2"
      ],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 132294,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 732079,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "AIMD & Rate Adaptation",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "flow-mu426zol-34"
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-mu426zol-34-note-0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 774,
      "y": 952,
      "width": 291,
      "height": 76,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp_mu426zop_2"
      ],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 674403,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 444347,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "Slow Start exponentially doubles cwnd\nevery RTT until reaching slow start\nthreshold (ssthresh), rapidly\ndiscovering bottleneck bandwidth.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-mu426zol-34-note-1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 774,
      "y": 1063,
      "width": 283,
      "height": 95,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp_mu426zop_2"
      ],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 513461,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 984386,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "Congestion Avoidance increments cwnd\nlinearly by 1 MSS per RTT once past\nssthresh, using Additive Increase\nMultiplicative Decrease (AIMD) to\nstabilize throughput.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "sub-mu426zol-30",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -605,
      "y": 1182,
      "width": 277,
      "height": 51,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ced4da",
      "backgroundColor": "#212529",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp_mu426zop_2"
      ],
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 400841,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 718506,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "sub-mu426zol-30_text",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sub-mu426zol-30_text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -593,
      "y": 1196,
      "width": 253,
      "height": 22,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp_mu426zop_2"
      ],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 148230,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 361160,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "Flow Control & Windowing",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sub-mu426zol-30"
    },
    {
      "id": "sub-mu426zol-30-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -969,
      "y": 1172,
      "width": 314,
      "height": 190,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp_mu426zop_2"
      ],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 391062,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 156464,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "Flow control prevents a fast sender from\noverwhelming a slow receiver. The\nreceiver advertises its available buffer\ncapacity in the 16-bit Window Size field\n(rwnd). When rwnd drops to 0, sender\nstops transmitting and periodically\nemits Zero-Window Probes to detect when\nreceiver buffer space clears. Window\nScaling option (RFC 7323) shifts window\nsize up to 1 GB.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
    {
      "id": "sub-mu426zol-21",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -195,
      "y": 1397,
      "width": 391,
      "height": 51,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ced4da",
      "backgroundColor": "#212529",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp_mu426zop_2"
      ],
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 205824,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 260408,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "sub-mu426zol-21_text",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sub-mu426zol-21_text",
      "type": "text",
